on't support UPI payments, so bring a card or cash.\nHighly recommended.👍","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25KT1RISk1ObEZtVVhWMmFWSjFkRGhHVURkdFQzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2a9fa3016cd1ac67!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnJOTHJMNlFmUXV2aVJ1dDhGUDdtT3c%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLc2PhUZ7oUG3jlT2OFbIfxaqcxSYV62iQZ10yfwYeF1ENQJ5BWfzU1qyu8aLe75Y6bahfmEsT2nq_xXH66NYfWCA3OVng6Fyr0Pha6WUP0EpYd2MV5nB4bEIB_TION3PBhaOtoLLwvYp1lu=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcbIDzsAIzY1Di1Iw2Nzboa12o1DDrJJsqv2vuzNhymd40JTX6WiL9sGANCjpC7vnKsLikrAUu-v_1m_cYpwxROqWrsaercbVPTF5Y99ULdOntLsayhWUvTx5OGMD4FF6oeCNIuFlq9qOrW=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLf987W2W7BYFSlv8bYO2N6S5vBr7HHi0wFqZ6WP43PmAq6MIXfQyV2Wg_a1yZY756NT03ij9aKVfHP5KHyKBqZOjGsYcrYCi0eAL8eQBcg0xHDiw_plS0KVDGie3hPlsOB5MkCxOPAU78hT=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLf_Iq0C75BdOyepw1vzM3ZLS41hsZpBN1ESkpE5T4JYEk6nzAdoWI74xc-7yPfCRNnThSF6Q5B1_bMoCN9qXhiPQR1MQHIT7umrg7I4WLFxPJDCd0MdhzqA-s4Fer-MZLedVvx5D038vMda=k-no"}],"date":"2 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-07-25T08:58:05+00:00"},{"username":"Sumit S. Thakur","rating":5,"contributor_id":"106522163981982349313","user_review_count":404,"user_photo_count":1052,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVj9RDEfnWG57u9SHQaN_Wj0Xk5QK0mzLYI5i64zWzc-TOKc9lK=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"Visited Fat Fish for lunch during our Goa stay. We had visited Aguada Fort and travelled all the way to Fat Fish specially for lunch — and it was worth it!\n\nThey have a good parking space and the restaurant is located right on the roadside, so it’s easy to find. Usually there is some waiting time, but the queue moves quite fast. They’ve also made a nice waiting area, so you won’t get bored. There’s a small boat setup and swings for kids, which is a thoughtful touch for families.\n\nThe menu has plenty of options. Once you place the order, food takes a little time to arrive, but the quality makes up for it. One thing to note is that rotis are not included in the thali, so you need to order them separately.\n\nWe ordered the King Fish Thali and Chicken Thali. The thalis were fully loaded with many side dishes including raita and veg bhaji. Portion sizes were huge — we honestly couldn’t finish everything!\n\nThe taste was awesome and we really enjoyed the food. We also ordered several mocktails, and even after that, the final bill felt quite reasonable for the quantity and quality served.\n\nThey also play music in the restaurant, which adds nicely to the overall atmosphere. A great place to enjoy Goan food with friends and family!","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201dk9XRnFUSEpxT0ZOdlFWUkRVVXBHZHpSd1drRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2a9fa3016cd1ac67!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm5vOWFqTHJqOFNvQVRDUUpGdzRwWkE%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdsWYnA6XmUsETzA79QMkjggDkMlyyxXJhfNRmatbFFP3bHGs6ufpZS20JNRk5VtK3uFPiq12bzPAXqxUW0HBefX6IoOQfjl-MbQt9RqhEOPcz5KxY4t1gnV5p65tBlvOQTSxNRoyaduBqg=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdT7lIb_bhTzAKIwgBi4qniQneWqsnzi1Vs-4pbh918awmsHcc0q5NK1RnpJ0tWKBX3NUfbvbAP7lH2lLn7hzSqtnTthU9-_LA0pF-AMGjhOstFkZpELaO83LeDdqd1wikH64E_-JZAkMXx=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfaqbS4rELs6bOt0mpVD2YwEqvRn3udwuCcCqEohSdb4kxkEzmoGhscxmA_-fpcJ283k8eQOwBhPaGjTphdOqqfDnftoL2v2jCDCaybAM3qBl-WpEYCWm3MxzCv9E5t6mDwpurU4BXOzvA=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeMQtHk6irmjtBtAyzOd4yHsRv7r7M7PTrJg7Jkh5QS4_uZtsrIT18cEJZK3rv-dkudydrMKbUKae5ASPCk6vAMF8ZlZQ_03JYYGo9_c8oBVTlj6xxdOXQDWkZweODKM5M-kjW9kSLMVus=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfMX5nW1GjS0qHuRv9mUSYV_3ba0TvBMhxmCav9UzryDr9aIzfIvEHvACcdedd-Qjsh5b2CBIBwI57O3BcK-q6EBGHaBhpJn8EKGy5dTbQ6QLvtm6xhnSDsgCK3julSXSM4eKY1IZ7Mb8tH=k-no"}],"date":"4 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-05-28T16:53:37+00:00"},{"username":"Kumar liking tour","rating":5,"contributor_id":"113700840078190851530","user_review_count":35,"user_photo_count":36,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVuHcPUTdTGFP5Tg0fu-JPZ2XkFaFUZrEpgXU_UQuqKWSESNouy=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","description":"The meal was an exceptional showcase of authentic Goan flavors. The Baked Crabs were a standout—perfectly prepared with a rich, flavorful stuffing that complemented the sweetness of the crab meat.\n​The Calamari was cooked to perfection in a vibrant Recheado Masala, offering that signature balance of spice and tanginess. To top it all off, the Fish Curry provided a comforting and soul-satisfying finish, truly capturing the essence of coastal dining.\n​\n​What made the evening even more memorable was the impeccable service. Despite the bustling atmosphere of Calangute Road, the service was remarkably fast and efficient.\n​The staff managed the floor with great professionalism, ensuring that even technical dishes like baked crabs were served promptly without compromising on quality. It was a seamless dining experience where the high standards of hospitality perfectly matched the excellence of the food.","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kSU1HdHFZbFZ3VWxKaFdqazNlVGN3T0hOR01YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2a9fa3016cd1ac67!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOndIMGtqYlVwUlJhWjk3eTcwOHNGMXc%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcQETx0eelZgq3snwXjiUOAE95fdY2d2KXqaLVF3qt4JX2rHdohKQSMNFn2rlZ3yEqfuaQXvFsAb8IlZBwuUqE117ZbJ_UeVuiXcBp0D7SQbyUOYuvbDSPEiB3x0rcCRwYsbA5ieG_o-s2h=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeD2ueoAJdNzcrxPVj3ZRfXG30WrB8v3bG1wKZzDQVMMHAKH3SLExlOqsQxTXplPRy7UWueXO73l4EeSigicQw1TbQMJ62yDmxC49b368UiuTdfefY8LoKQeW9OThtUlzA604lUv14y3omm=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLewJpCGfKRATueU2M0nanEhrBi4Px1qWUj-8r4cdNSDKQOHXtt3i4RhtFrM41E6DsRIhyiSHggsOSBWsPKS4C4PAiZMVg_KiyKM6eKuKTXAtBbNCeG59Q9H94bbTC73gXjwRtSnL0yAgU03=k-no"}],"date":"4 months ago","date_iso8601":"2026-05-12T12:16:53+00:00"},{"username":"Anandi Kabade","rating":3,"contributor_id":"105503362779922047332","user_review_count":6,"user_photo_count":10,"user_thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXSKoR1WXmHuDKyQwhzP7jFLzG138O4rn6AV9Djvc8Ftj1vt-oH=s120-c-rp-mo-br100","description":"I have visited Fat Fish many times, and it continues to be one of my favorite places for seafood in Goa. The food is absolutely amazing—fresh, flavorful, and consistently delicious every single time. The ambience is also very nice, giving a relaxed and lively vibe that makes the whole experience even better.\n\nHowever, one thing I’ve noticed during my multiple visits is that weekends get extremely crowded. Because of this, the service tends to slow down a lot. The staff is polite and doing their best, but the food takes quite a long time to arrive on weekends. On weekdays, the service is smooth and much faster, and the experience is perfect.\n\nI would like to request the owner to please consider improving the service during weekends, as the waiting time can be quite long. With such incredible food and ambience, better service during peak hours would make this place absolutely perfect!","link":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xwalZGUnBhamhwT1U5T1MzZFJkREUxVkZkWlQyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2a9fa3016cd1ac67!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlpjVFRpajhpOU9OS3dRdDE1VFdZT2c%7C%7C?hl=en-GB","images":[{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfwdUgV2j6M39GKCQOjyO2SnDg6zMNwNid2LzyYqiMHcg0gSzPhfs_kW1OoCuZGgXmkU3Z8TcAHuPNol-B-Mbb0REqPcRbnntMKxO5_UCaZxamqbWOhsb8qfQrSYhKZMyAWhXgOhCnRZm01=k-no"},{"thumbnail":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/gra